    to total revenue relative to their share of the customer base. The top 10 customers alone generated <strong>{fmt_money(top20_customers.head(10)['revenue'].sum())}</strong>.
    Retention programs should focus on migrating Occasional buyers into the Regular tier. Demographic and loyalty membership data,
    if joined from the customers dimension table, would enable richer segmentation by age, gender, and loyalty status.
  </div>
</div>

<!-- FOOTER -->
<div class="footer">
  <p>Chocolate Retail Sales Performance Report (2023–2024) &nbsp;|&nbsp; Generated {datetime.now().strftime('%B %d, %Y')} &nbsp;|&nbsp; Data: {fmt_num(total_orders)} transactions</p>
  <p style="margin-top:4px">Prepared for Retail Management. All figures derived from transaction data.</p>
