    <strong>{disc_summary['nodisc_avg_qty']:.2f}</strong> for non-discounted. Management should evaluate whether the volume uplift
    from discounting sufficiently offsets the per-unit margin loss, particularly at higher discount tiers where erosion accelerates.
  </div>
</div>

<!-- CUSTOMER INSIGHTS -->
