    to total revenue relative to their share of the customer base. The top 10 customers alone generated <strong>{fmt_money(top20_customers.head(10)['revenue'].sum())}</strong>.
    Retention programs should focus on migrating Occasional buyers into the Regular tier. Demographic and loyalty membership data,
